  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Glossary?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Main screen</b></span></h3>\n<p>This is the main screen <a href=\"/wiki/hay-day-8519\" title=\"Hay Day\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hay Day</a>. Click on an icon to find out more:\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center noresize\"><span><img alt=\"Hay Day GUI\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e0/Hay_Day_GUI.png/revision/latest?cb=20160413145720\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"587\" height=\"331\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>​\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Main screen icons</b></span></h3>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/db/Settings_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171227165326\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Settings Icon\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/db/Settings_Icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20171227165326\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Access <a href=\"/wiki/settings-22791\" title=\"Settings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">settings</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b8/Avatar_Following_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171227173700\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Avatar Following Icon\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b8/Avatar_Following_Icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20171227173700\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Your avatar</li>\n<li>Avatar for farmers you follow (blue border)</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c4/Avatar_Neighbor_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171227171121\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Avatar Neighbor Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Avatar for your <a href=\"/wiki/neighborhood-10438\" title=\"Neighborhood\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">neighbors</a> (green border)</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/6d/Avatar_Other_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171227192140\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Avatar Other Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Avatar for other farmers (yellow border)</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/69/Experience_Bar.png/revision/latest?cb=20240126131743\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Experience Bar\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"128\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Experience</a> bar for your current level</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/1a/Reputation_Bar.png/revision/latest?cb=20141231163759\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Reputation Bar\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/reputation-14275\" title=\"Reputation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Reputation</a> bar for your current level</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/65/Follow_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171229103207\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Follow Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Follow or unfollow a farm. A maximum of 10 farms can be followed (not including social media friends).</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9b/Like_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171229103218\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Like Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Like this farm on social media</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/0b/Invite_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20180115154508\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Invite Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Invite Facebook friends to your <a href=\"/wiki/neighborhood-10438\" title=\"Neighborhood\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">neighborhood</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b9/Buy_Currency_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171227165920\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Buy Currency Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n</span></td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Buy <a href=\"/wiki/coin-6079\" title=\"Coin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">additional coins</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a> with real money.</li>\n<li>Invite farmer to your <a href=\"/wiki/neighborhood-10438\" title=\"Neighborhood\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Neighborhood</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/3a/Buy_Vouchers_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20240126131849\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Buy Vouchers Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"104\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n</span></td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Buy <a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vouchers</a> using diamonds</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b1/Edit_Mode_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20160308192446\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Edit Mode Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Access <a href=\"/wiki/edit-mode-24078\" title=\"Edit Mode\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Edit Mode</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/01/Friends_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20160312124226\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Friends Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Access the <a href=\"/wiki/friends-7721\" title=\"Friends\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">friends</a> bar</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/93/Booster_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20170327174855\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Booster Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Access <a href=\"/wiki/booster-28721\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Booster\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">boosters</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/76/Shop_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20240126131957\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shop Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"115\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Open the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shop</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/38/Farm_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171227184623\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Farm Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Go back to your <a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farm</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/76/Town_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171229110148\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Town Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Go back to your <a href=\"/wiki/town-13129\" title=\"Town\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">town</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a4/Neighborhood_Panel_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171227190519\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Neighborhood Panel Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Open the <a href=\"/wiki/neighborhood-10438\" title=\"Neighborhood\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">neighborhood</a> panel</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Other icons</b></span></h3>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9f/Information_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171227191217\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Information Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Tap for more information or to replay a tutorial</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/3a/Close_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171227170041\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Close Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Close window</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d7/Confirm_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171227171446\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Confirm Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Confirm action</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/63/Trash_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171227165353\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Trash Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Remove the <a href=\"/wiki/truck-2673\" title=\"Truck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">truck order</a></li>\n<li>Remove the <a href=\"/wiki/derby-18422\" title=\"Derby\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">derby task</a></li>\n<li>Remove an item from your <a href=\"/wiki/roadside-shop-2677\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">roadside shop</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c3/Switch_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171227183913\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Switch Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Rotate the item</li>\n<li>Display more <a href=\"/wiki/crops-3568\" title=\"Crops\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">crops</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a></li>\n<li>Send away <a href=\"/wiki/town-visitors-13241\" title=\"Town Visitors\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">town visitors</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/cf/Upgrade_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171229103920\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Upgrade Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Upgrade your <a href=\"/wiki/buildings-3577\" title=\"Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">building</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9f/Speed_Up_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171229103232\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Speed Up Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Speed things up using <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/dc/Advertise_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171227201149\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Advertise Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Advertise your products in the <a href=\"/wiki/roadside-shop-2677\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Roadside Shop</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/38/Send_Truck_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171227192410\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Send Truck Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Send <a href=\"/wiki/truck-2673\" title=\"Truck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">truck</a> order</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/32/Send_Riverboat_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20141231155409\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Send Riverboat Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"85\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Send full <a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">boat</a> or discard empty boat</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b7/Personal_Train_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20180115154526\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Personal Train Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Send <a href=\"/wiki/personal-train-13479\" title=\"Personal Train\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">personal train</a> to your town</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/82/More_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171227192151\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"More Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Tap to see information about your <a href=\"/wiki/buildings-3577\" title=\"Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">building</a></li>\n<li>Tap to edit your <a href=\"/wiki/neighborhood-10438\" title=\"Neighborhood\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">neighborhood</a> settings</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Helping other players icons</b></span></h3>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7a/Help_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20171227184028\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Help Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Revive <a href=\"/wiki/trees-and-bushes-7454\" title=\"Trees and Bushes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tree or bush</a></li>\n<li>Fill <a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">boat</a> crate</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/62/Megaphone.png/revision/latest?cb=20151211051442\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Megaphone\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"89\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Post a message on Facebook to let your friends know you need help</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a5/Message.png/revision/latest?cb=20151211051442\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Message\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Send a <a href=\"/wiki/gift-card-16941\" title=\"Gift Card\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">thank-you note</a> to players who have helped you</li>\n<li>Invite friends to your <a href=\"/wiki/neighborhood-10438\" title=\"Neighborhood\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">neighborhood</a> through social media</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260830165008\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.086 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.111 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 454/1000000\